<!-- Round-trip PRODUCER: a DotKt Kotlin LIBRARY compiled to a CLR dll carrying DotKt.Metadata attributes
     ([KotlinFunction]/[KotlinFileClass]/[Kotlin*]...). It is consumed AS KOTLIN by ../consumer through a
     <ProjectReference> — facadegen re-imports THIS dll's metadata (NEVER its source). The DLL-not-source
     invariant (docs/design-nunit-test-harness.md §3): the producer lives in a SIBLING directory of the
     consumer precisely so the consumer's `**/*.kt` glob cannot pull the source in — the round-trip is real
     only if the consumer resolves the API via the built dll.

     Each *.kt here is one migrated verify-roundtrip.sh section's library, given its OWN package so the many
     colliding simple names (Box/Money/...) coexist in this single producer assembly. Resolves the LOCALLY-BUILT
     SDK from build/nuget-feed via tests/nuget.config (design D4). -->
<Project Sdk="DotKt.Sdk/0.9.6-rc7">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <OutputType>Library</OutputType>
    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
